      "content": "A chaotic airport is truly frustrating, but try to maintain a calm, focused approach. Instead of getting caught in the general stampede, try to find a quieter area—perhaps a lounge if you have access, or even just a less crowded corner near a gate—to check your phone and monitor updates. If the customer service lines are too long, look for a dedicated airline desk for rebookings rather than general information desks, as they are usually better equipped to handle cancellations. Keep your boarding pass and passport easily accessible, just in case you need to sprint to a gate.",
